==In popular culture==
[[Wolf 359 (The Outer Limits)|Wolf 359]] is an episode of the original [[The Outer Limits (1963 TV series)|''The Outer Limits'']] television show. It first aired on 7 November 1964, during its second season.

Wolf 359 is notable for being the location and namesake of the [[The Best of Both Worlds (Star Trek: The Next Generation)|Battle of Wolf 359]] in the [[Star Trek]] universe.

A space station in orbit around the star is the primary setting of [[Wolf 359 (podcast)]].

